      "title": "Quellbrook Harbour Light: the keepers, 1868-1971",
      "publish_date": "2019-04-02",
      "excerpts": [
        "The first keeper of Quellbrook Harbour Light was Tobias Wren, appointed when the light was first lit in 1868.\n\nEleven keepers served at the light before it was automated in 1971, the longest of them Margaret Wren, Tobias's daughter, for twenty-two years."
      ]
